      "description": "Compact image-overlay zoom controls and percentage reset.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-zoom\" aria-label=\"Picture zoom\"><button aria-label=\"Zoom out\" disabled>−</button><button class=\"ds-reset\" aria-label=\"Reset zoom\">100<span>%</span></button><button aria-label=\"Zoom in\">+</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-zoom{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;background:#faf7ef;color:var(--ink,#484738);border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 3px 15px #32271220;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif}.ds-zoom button{display:grid;place-items:center;border:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;cursor:pointer;min-width:40px;min-height:42px;padding:0 10px;font:22px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;border-radius:4px}.ds-zoom button:hover:not(:disabled){background:#e9e5d8}.ds-zoom button:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:default}.ds-zoom .ds-reset{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:56px;gap:2px;font-size:11px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-reset span{font-size:9px}.ds-zoom button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#53634e);outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-zoom button{min-width:44px;min-height:44px}}"
    },
